(text "REV U: 288V 32GB / FICTIONAL PEX90064 / THUNDERBOLT 3 HOST\nPEX90064 has an invented 1024-ball map. 12 E1.S x4 plus CPU x4; 12 spare lanes. Nominal SSD side/bottom gap 7mm. TB3 host: Alpine Ridge DP + TPS65982. CPU PMIC / BIOS / NVM / SI qualification pending.\nCPU pin directions and power inputs are modeled. ERC power-driver errors expose unfinished supply domains.\nSee README.md and VALIDATION.json before manufacturing." (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "14cbb462-5cf8-4139-81ec-d92110630ebb"))
